{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它将H18、H19、H20中加力不能保证所珍惜之物留下、但在乎仍然存在的矛盾，接到M3所提供的局部心理过程上，具体说明了急迫暂退后为何能够在不再紧绷的情况下继续靠近，没有新增前史或把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它依据H10、H14、H17中快乐与担心反复交替、依恋与失落同时存在的既有历史，解释了为何温柔重新出现时惜别感便已跟上；临走前回头看一眼是表达心理状态的比喻，不是新增的外部事件，也没有改变原有的情绪主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它将H8、H12、H18、H23中身体无法继续维持紧张、积压重量暂时释放而在乎并未变轻的既有因果说清楚，并补出了身体松开后温柔得以重新浮现的局部心理过程，没有把喘息误写成问题已经解决。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都分别交代了当下的感受及其心理成因，即使不看听感记录，也能理解急迫退下、失落延续、身体暂时放松与依恋仍在之间的关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a7d7a311-75e0-4f48-a754-a59273fe5f78", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144920875065Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:51:04.942665+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6e5cf3d03b4d05862b7ad3b9fda3a07be69eceeea68407c0423e3cf8ee67359", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sh